  "decision": {
    "chosen_policy": "keep_alive",
    "rationale": "At 1 thread (Studio's actual usage pattern), keep-alive has 0% failure rate with lower max latency. Multi-thread stress is not representative of real Studio usage (single-threaded UI). Keep-alive avoids per-request connection overhead and matches Qt Studio's 5s idle timeout behavior (kIdleDisconnectMs = 5000)."
  },
